","gloss":"if taking"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"if [one] takes"},{"surface":"கடைப்புணை","parts":[{"text":"கடை","lemma":"கடை","gloss":"end/tail"},{"text":"புணை","lemma":"புணை","gloss":"raft"}],"gloss":"tail raft"},{"surface":"கொள்ளும்","parts":[{"text":"கொள்ளும்","lemma":"கொள்","gloss":"will hold"}],"gloss":"will hold"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புணை","parts":[{"text":"புணை","lemma":"புணை","gloss":"raft"}],"gloss":"raft"},{"surface":"கைவிட்டு","parts":[{"text":"கை","lemma":"கை","gloss":"hand"},{"text":"விட்டு","lemma":"விடு","gloss":"letting go"}],"gloss":"abandoning"},{"surface":"புனலோடு","parts":[{"text":"புனல்","lemma":"புனல்","gloss":"water/flood"},{"text":"ஓடு","lemma":"ஓடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the water"},{"surface":"ஒழுகின்","parts":[{"text":"ஒழுகின்","lemma":"ஒழுகு","gloss":"if flowing/drifting"}],"gloss":"if drifting"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆண்டும்","parts":[{"text":"ஆண்டு","lemma":"ஆண்டு","gloss":"there"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"there too"},{"surface":"வருகுவள்","parts":[{"text":"வரு","lemma":"வா","gloss":"come"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"empty particle"},{"text":"அள்","lemma":"அள்","gloss":"she"}],"gloss":"she will come"},{"surface":"போலும்","parts":[{"text":"போலும்","lemma":"போலும்","gloss":"it seems"}],"gloss":"it seems"},{"surface":"மாண்ட","parts":[{"text":"மாண்ட","lemma":"மாண்","gloss":"excellent/glorious"}],"gloss":"excellent"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மாரி","parts":[{"text":"மாரி","lemma":"மாரி","gloss":"rain"}],"gloss":"rainy season"},{"surface":"பித்திகத்து","parts":[{"text":"பித்திகத்து","lemma":"பித்திகத்து","gloss":"of the wild jasmine"}],"gloss":"of the wild jasmine","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நீர்வார்","parts":[{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"நீர்","gloss":"water"},{"text":"வார்","lemma":"வார்","gloss":"dripping"}],"gloss":"dripping water"},{"surface":"கொழுமுகை","parts":[{"text":"கொழு","lemma":"கொழு","gloss":"plump"},{"text":"முகை","lemma":"முகை","gloss":"bud"}],"gloss":"plump bud"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"செவ்வெரி","parts":[{"text":"செவ்வெரி","lemma":"செவ்வெரி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நுறழும்","parts":[{"text":"நுறழும்","lemma":"நுறழும்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கொழுங்கடை","parts":[{"text":"கொழுங்கடை","lemma":"கொழுங்கடை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மழைக்கட்","parts":[{"text":"மழைக்கட்","lemma":"மழைக்கட்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"டுளிதலைத்","parts":[{"text":"டுளிதலைத்","lemma":"டுளிதலைத்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தலைஇய","parts":[{"text":"தலைஇய","lemma":"தலைஇய","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தளிரன்","parts":[{"text":"தளிரன்","lemma":"தளிரன்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"னோளே","parts":[{"text":"னோளே","lemma":"னோளே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"If [one] takes the lead raft, [she] will hold the lead raft / If [one] takes the tail raft, [she] will hold the tail raft / Letting go of the raft, if [one] drifts with the water / there too she will come, it seems, the excellent / rainy season wild jasmine's water-dripping plump bud's / red streaks resembling rich outer corner cool eyes / having drops showered tender shoot-like she.","translation":"If I take the lead raft, she holds the lead raft. If I take the tail raft, she holds the tail raft. If I let go of the raft and drift with the current, she too will come there, it seems—she who is like a tender shoot, with cool eyes whose rich outer corners, marked with red streaks, resemble the water-dripping, plump buds of the wild jasmine in the glorious rainy season.","modern":"நான் முன்னால் செல்லும் மிதவையைப் பற்றிக்கொண்டால், அவளும் அந்த முன்னால் செல்லும் மிதவையைப் பற்றிக்கொள்வாள். நான் பின்னால் செல்லும் மிதவையைப் பற்றிக்கொண்டால், அவளும் அந்தப் பின்னால் செல்லும் மிதவையைப் பற்றிக்கொள்வாள். மிதவையை விட்டுவிட்டு நீரில் மிதந்து சென்றால், அவளும் அங்கேயும் என்னோடு வருவாள் போலிருக்கிறது. சிறந்த மழைக்காலத்து காட்டு மல்லிகையின் நீர் சொட்டும் செழுமையான மொட்டின் செவ்வரியைப் போன்ற அழகிய குளிர்ந்த கண்களையும், தளிர் போன்ற உடலையும் உடையவள் அவள்.","explanation":"The hero speaks to himself about the heroine's absolute devotion and love. He describes how she follows him unconditionally in every situation, using the metaphor of a raft in a rushing river. Whether he takes the lead raft, the rear raft, or even if he abandons the raft to drift freely in the current, she is right there beside him. Her eyes are beautifully compared to the fresh, water-dripping buds of the wild jasmine (pittikam) of the rainy season, which are marked with delicate red streaks. This imagery of water, rafts, and fresh blossoms belongs to the Kuriñci tiṇai, symbolizing the deep, inseparable union of the lovers.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}